WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:35.850
The world of my lost memories led to Egypt 3,000 years ago.

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:40.680
Where priests fought Bandit King Bakura.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:46.320
They summoned and battled with monsters, just like duelists.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:52.800
I’ll summon the three Gods and defeat you, Bakura!

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.800
Mahad’s Determination

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.560
It fended off a God.

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:26.560
A draw.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:30.600
I can’t believe he could summon a God so quickly.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.240
If I didn’t get this gift from Kaiba...

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.680
Pharaoh, we'll settle this on a future turn.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:43.710
You there!  Mahad, right?

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:49.770
The Millennium Ring you're wearing used to belong to me.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.280
Actually, it'll belong to me soon.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:56.220
I won’t let you have my Millennium Ring!

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:58.680
Calm down.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:03.530
I'll eventually take all your Millennium Items!

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:04.870
See ya!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:06.730
Bakura!

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:12.660
Don’t let him escape!

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.390
- After him!
- Guards!

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:15.250
Yes sir!

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.020
Retreat!

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:40.680
Bakura...

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:46.920
What's that?

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.670
Pharaoh.

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:49.620
Are you hurt?

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.480
What is that?

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:58.080
I don’t see anything.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:01.090
You don't see it?

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.690
No.

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:05.240
What did you see, Pharaoh?

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:07.090
It's nothing.

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:11.960
Does it have something to do with the Shadow Game?

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:19.650
The power of the Pharaoh’s God...

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.840
And a Ka that rivals it.

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:32.920
The Gods aren't the most powerful?

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:34.990
Seto?

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:39.430
I’m glad you're safe, Pharaoh.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.370
Burst Stream of Destruction...

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:46.530
Why does Bakura have Blue-Eyes’s power?

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:52.640
My connection with Blue-Eyes...

00:04:55.060 --> 00:05:00.510
I don't care about Bakura’s talk of the occult.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:05.620
But Blue-Eyes's cry...

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:10.490
No way...  Stop!

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.940
What was that?

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:38.390
Silly ideas - like fate and destiny - don't affect me.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:42.270
But in order to expose this trick...

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:55.100
We still don’t know where Bakura went?

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:55.980
No.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:06:02.540
But we deployed our soldiers far and wide - to the castle town, desert and canyon.

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:05.920
He won't escape our net.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:11.560
But Bakura’s Diabound has incredible power.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:15.360
If the Pharaoh couldn’t use his God...

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:19.300
The priests didn't have the strength to win.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:20.660
God...

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:24.370
I have an idea, Aknadin.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:29.810
There must be citizens that have Ka inside them.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:38.180
If we capture them, we can use their Ka as powerful weapons.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:39.960
Don’t be a fool!

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:45.470
We endured rigorous training, so there’s no Ka that's stronger than ours.

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:49.730
But Bakura’s Diabound had terrifying power.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:53.240
What if that power came from his hate?

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:58.800
I bet you don't know that whoever gathers the seven Millennium Items...

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:04.500
...and sets them in the tablet at Kul Elna Village gains the power of the afterlife.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:07.940
He knew about Kul Elna Village.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:14.850
If he's a survivor of that incident, his hatred will be immeasurable.

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:16.780
Aknadin.

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:22.790
There must be thieves and criminals like Bakura who are filled with hate.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:29.500
We may find a Ka that rivals a Diabound.  Or even a God.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:33.520
No!  You must not create a Ka using hate!

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:35.440
That's too dangerous.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:37.960
It's to help the Pharaoh.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:42.370
If this lessens the number of criminals, we’re killing two birds with one stone.

00:07:42.370 --> 00:07:43.600
Seto.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:49.410
For the kingdom to prosper, we must be willing to get our hands covered in blood.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:55.380
I believe my father - who lost his life in battle - would agree.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.420
Nothing?

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:23.350
Ever since Bakura arrived, the future is covered in a disturbing shadow.

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:30.560
I must see through this darkness to prevent a catastrophe from striking the kingdom.

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.540
Don’t overexert yourself.

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:36.730
In your fight against Bakura, you lost a lot of Ba.

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:41.410
It's important to recover Ba for the next fight.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.400
You must rest, Isis.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:46.870
Thank you, Karim and Shada.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:52.350
But only my Millennium Necklace can tell us what Bakura’s next move will be.

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:58.290
For the Pharaoh and our people, I can't afford to rest.

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.060
Everyone...

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:17.700
Partner...

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.880
Which one's the true door?

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:34.560
Every time we open a door, more appear.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.720
There’s no end to 'em.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:42.240
The hands on my watch haven’t moved since we arrived at the tablet.

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:44.480
You’re right.

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:48.900
Can we really get out of here?

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:51.240
Wait!

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:53.040
That one!

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:55.940
I sense something intense from that door!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:59.640
I'll trust your instincts, Jonouchi!

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:00.920
Yeah!

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:02.580
W-Wait!

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:07.050
No way!

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:11.430
Help us!

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:13.900
Huh?

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:18.770
We're safe!

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:23.260
Some doors have traps.  Be careful.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.440
Say that earlier!

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:32.310
How do we find the true door among all these doors?

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:38.320
Maybe only Yugi knows which door it is.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:42.710
Because Yugi is the one who knows the other Yugi the best.

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:45.710
Do you sense anything?

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:51.270
I'm not sure, but I feel a lot of sadness here.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:54.270
As if his heart is closed.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:11:00.370
I may be sensing my other self’s sadness.

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:25.640
Everyone here knows who I am.

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:30.500
But I don't know anyone.

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:35.140
As a Pharaoh, did I truly understand them?

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.440
And did they know the real me?

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:41.560
Pharaoh.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.320
You’re...

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.750
It was...

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:47.460
Mahad?

00:11:47.460 --> 00:11:51.190
Pharaoh, you shouldn't be here alone.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:54.990
Remember yesterday?  Please be careful.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:55.860
You’re right.

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:58.800
My mistake.  I'll be more careful.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.740
Uh no...  I didn’t mean it like that.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:11.040
Who's there!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.450
Mana!  What are you doing!

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:20.160
Step away from the Pharaoh!

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:24.320
Master, I was listening to your conversation.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:26.170
Why were you talking so formal?

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:30.430
You and the Prince can talk casually when alone, like in the past.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.460
He’s not a Prince.  He’s the Pharaoh!

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:36.990
You know about my past?

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:38.570
Of course we do.

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.140
We three have been together forever.

00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:45.210
Experimenting with magic, honing our martial arts skills...

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:47.820
We were like a family!

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:50.150
Y-Yeah.  That’s right.

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:53.150
You really are the Prince, right?

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:56.160
There’s something different about you.

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:57.820
You fool!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:00.190
He just became the Pharaoh!

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:04.450
The Prince now has huge responsibilities that we can’t even imagine!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.830
Master, you said “Prince!”

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.910
Forgive me, Pharaoh.

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:14.640
Anyway, how did you get here?

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:21.140
My magic skills have improved!

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:23.090
A paralysis spell?

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.810
You fool!  Free them now!

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:28.610
You're leaving the palace unguarded!

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:30.260
That’s bad.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:33.470
Huh?

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:35.840
What’s wrong?  Hurry up!

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:37.560
The release spell is...

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.430
Please wait a sec.

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:44.540
Enough.  I’ll do it!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.480
Mahad and Mana.

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:50.460
For them, I did exist.

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.570
I had friends.

00:13:57.280 --> 00:14:02.960
I was overconfident to try to get all seven Millennium Items at once.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:07.390
I only need to have all seven Millennium Items at the end.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:12.930
When I do, I'll discover the eighth key that opens the door to the afterlife.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:18.020
I’ll start by getting the Millennium Ring first.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:27.810
Look at what Bakura did!

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:29.750
Priest!

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:31.220
What is it?

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.680
Will the town be set on fire again?

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:36.690
Don’t worry.

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:39.460
I won't let it happen again.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:40.790
Okay!

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:58.620
Bakura, I won't let the people suffer anymore!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.120
Lame!

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:11.320
I was hoping Master would give me a magic lesson.

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.790
Since Mahad is a priest, he's busy.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.730
Please be patient.

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.740
Okay, Prince.

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:19.670
Prince?

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:22.190
My mistake.  I meant Pharaoh.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.060
No, I mean...

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:29.550
Mana, do you know my name?

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:31.830
What do you mean?

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:34.130
You're Prince!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:36.300
I mean, the Pharaoh.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.220
So you don’t know?

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:42.180
The Pharaoh is the Pharaoh, and the Prince is the Pharaoh.

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:45.190
But the Prince is the Prince...  Uhh...

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:55.720
Mahad.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:56.900
Isis.

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:03.410
Has your Millennium Necklace found Bakura?

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:04.960
Nothing yet.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:07.070
How about your Millennium Ring?

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:10.510
Nothing at all.

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:12.670
I see.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.530
Don’t worry.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:17.620
The future will bless the Pharaoh.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:18.420
Yes.

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:32.590
Darkness...  Bakura is still filled with evil.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:39.330
No, there's a tear in the darkness.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.790
Mahad.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:59.230
As the chief guardian of the Pharaoh’s Tomb, I will go to Pharaoh Aknamkanon’s tomb.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:04.660
And conduct a ritual to create a new magical seal to protect the Pharaoh’s tomb.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.610
I’m counting on you.

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:12.050
If the seal is ever broken again, you’ll lose your position as a priest.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:17.540
And if Bakura shows up, don’t fight him alone.

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:19.820
You’re not strong enough to defeat him.

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:23.260
Priest Seto, that's enough!

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:26.420
Mahad, protect my father’s tomb.

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:33.850
I’m going too!

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:35.540
I’m going!

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:37.980
I’m going to protect my master!

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:39.690
Stop it, Mana!

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:42.320
Ouch...

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:45.990
You're Mahad's student, but you don't trust him?

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.570
Of course I trust him.

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:52.210
But while he's creating the seal, he'll be defenseless!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.920
That’s why I have to help!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.970
Mana, you don’t truly know your master.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:05.990
You won't find a magician as great as Mahad in Egypt, or in the world.

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:07.200
So don't worry.

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:09.130
Shimon...

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:16.070
His magic is so strong that he had to seal away some of his power.

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:23.250
If he unleashes his full power, none of the other priests are any match for him.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.720
Mahad.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.250
Isis.

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:36.120
Won't you change your mind?

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:41.070
You saw my future, didn’t you.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.560
No need to say more.

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:49.960
Protect the Pharaoh.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:53.880
However...

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:57.840
The one who wins in the end... is you.

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:08.620
Pharaoh...

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:15.700
Here.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.640
Thank you!

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:19.040
Prince!

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.010
Prince!

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:32.980
Mahad!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:36.420
Prince, are you okay?

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.180
Mahad!

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:40.490
Don’t worry about me.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:41.530
Don’t move.

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:45.050
Prince!  Please stop!

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:47.560
The future Pharaoh needn’t do this!

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:50.270
There's no difference between me and you.

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:55.340
Red blood flows within you, just like red blood flows within me.

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:56.930
We're the same.

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.210
Prince...

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:06.400
I'll create a world where everyone can live freely, where social status doesn't matter.

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:11.290
The new world the Prince spoke of...

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:16.720
Though it's still far from reality, I know you'll create it.

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:21.100
That's why I want to protect you.

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:24.110
Shouldn't we go left to get to the Valley of the Kings?

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:25.320
Silence!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.270
Just stay with Mahad!

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:51.950
In order to defeat his Diabound, I must release all my magical Heka powers.

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:57.800
I'll likely be forced to use forbidden techniques in this battle.

00:20:58.680 --> 00:21:00.430
Let's do this, Bakura!

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:03.510
I know you were following me!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:10.310
I accept your invitation, Mahad.

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:24.290
How annoying.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:46.400
I’ve been waiting for you, Bakura!

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:14.060
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.220 --> 00:22:29.780
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:35.620
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.940 --> 00:22:44.190
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.580 --> 00:22:49.830
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:50.020 --> 00:22:58.300
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.660 --> 00:23:04.110
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:12.250
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:15.510
In a duel

00:23:26.480 --> 00:23:31.180
While we were lost in the Millennium Puzzle's labyrinth...

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:37.090
...Mahad was about to battle Bandit King Bakura in Yugi's world of memories.

00:23:37.090 --> 00:23:41.210
Devoted to the Pharaoh, Mahad faces Bakura alone.

00:23:41.210 --> 00:23:45.680
But Bakura's Diabound has powered up greatly than before.

00:23:45.680 --> 00:23:48.200
Can Mahad win?

00:23:48.200 --> 00:23:51.770
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Battle to the Death!  Mahad vs Bakura

00:23:51.770 --> 00:23:53.000
Stay tuned!
